# Fieldline
{.lead} The operations layer for distributed field teams.

---

## The problem
Field teams run on spreadsheets and group chats. Work slips through the gaps, and nobody notices until it is already late.

---

## The shift
One place for every job, asset, and update, on any device, online or off. The office and the field finally see the same picture.

---

## How it works
```mdp:flow
Capture -> Assign -> Track -> Report
```

